    "Declare model roots, catalogs, field groups, creation artifacts, validation artifacts, Character sheet projections, and operation indexes.",
    "Allow Chronicle to load the Character model without Werewolf-specific application registration.",
    "Support package validation, capability discovery, diagnostics, migrations, fixtures, and tests."
