  "prototypeNotes": [
    "This index is the canonical discovery surface for the complete Character model.",
    "Chronicle loads the model entirely from package artifacts and never invokes Werewolf-specific registration code.",
    "Catalogs, fields, creation behavior, validation, operations, and sheet projection remain independently versioned but consistently indexed.",
    "Blocked optional capabilities remain visible without disabling the supported core Character creation flow.",
    "Historical completion snapshots preserve the model versions that gave a Character its original mechanical meaning.",
    "Chronicle owns discovery, contract validation, package isolation, diagnostics, persistence, and migration boundaries.",
    "The Rule Set package owns model structure, catalog content, field semantics, validation semantics, and operation contracts."
  ]
